# .claude-context — nutrition-labels repo map (token-optimized)

## Stack
- **Frontend**: React 18 + TypeScript, Vite, Zustand (recipe/saved/prefs/theme), React Query, Tailwind
- **Backend**: FastAPI + SQLite (read-only, FTS5), Jinja2, WeasyPrint, slowapi
- **Infra**: docker-compose — db-init → backend(:8000) + frontend(nginx) behind Caddy TLS

## Tree (essentials)
```
backend/app/{main,config,constants,database,models,nutrition,pdf,search}.py
backend/templates/label.html         FDA Jinja2 template (rendered by pdf.render_label_html)
backend/data/build_db_full.py        one-time DB builder (USDA FDC CSVs)
frontend/src/
  utils/{nutrition,units,stepText,id}.ts
  api/client.ts          HTTP client (search / food detail / generate label / downloadBlob)
