### `main.py` — Routes & middleware
```
GET  /api/health                 -> HealthResponse {"status":"ok","release":...}
                                    Probes DB (SELECT 1 FROM food_macros LIMIT 1); 503 if unavailable
GET  /api/search?query=str       -> list[FoodSearchResult]
                                    [] if query < 2 chars; 400 if > 100; rate 60/min
GET  /api/food/{fdc_id}          -> FoodDetail; 404 if not found; rate 120/min; Path(ge=1)
POST /api/generate_label         -> Response(PDF bytes, "application/pdf")
  Body: GenerateLabelRequest      rate 10/min  timeout 10s  concurrency 2 (semaphore)
  Headers: Content-Disposition: attachment; filename="nutrition_label.pdf"
           Cache-Control: no-store
  Errors: 400 (validation / missing fdc_ids) | 429 (+Retry-After) | 504 (timeout) | 500

Middleware order:  BodySizeLimitMiddleware(64 KB) -> TrustedHostMiddleware -> CORSMiddleware (dev only)
Logging:           single-line JSON to stdout; LOG_LEVEL env (default INFO)
Global handlers:   RateLimitExceeded -> 429 JSON + Retry-After; Exception -> 500 JSON (logged)
```

